{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve the released plugin ordering contract.** Existing configurations promise hooks in registration order, but this reverses every invocation-end hook in a patch release. Plugins may consequently observe another plugin's MDC, thread-local state, resources, or cleanup side effects in an incompatible phase. Keep forward order for existing plugins, or introduce an explicit/versioned LIFO opt-in with compatibility coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc772Boq","finding_digest":"6a6a364423079980f182e8d5380ffe41cbf54169c4fd16e9b84450553a2a3bdc","finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","finding_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"4a10bddd04d5ccea483ca2b627510ee0b589d5a0d617f06a2506c9483c23c703","observation_id":"aro_v1_jiil3xie2xgousb4uk3couio4c","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_njvdmrbda6myb4mc5dktqd76ih","published_at":"2026-10-08T23:42:45Z","review_id":"arr_v1_s4ljsp32vhruyz2jlsklvyk2yl","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"78e3b48d4534c400862aabed308e4129cc4c9c1d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":771},"record_id":"art_v1_likxqnxfzc65t3khyduhtbjlxo","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T23:42:45Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
